</span><span class="Comment-dh5VVn">/* ===== PANTALLAS PEQUEÑAS ===== */</span><span>

</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">@media </span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">max-width</span><span>: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">600px</span><span>) {

  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">.contenedor-contacto </span><span>{
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">padding</span><span>: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">25px</span><span>;
  }

  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">.encabezado-contacto </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">h1 </span><span>{
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">font-size</span><span>: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">26px</span><span>;
  }

}
</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="group/scroll-to-bottom cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-secondary transition-[width,opacity] duration-120 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none end-1/2 print:hidden w-8 pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Ir al final" tabindex="-1" type="button"><span class="pointer-events-none flex h-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding shadow-md transition-[width] duration-120 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none w-8"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC text-default" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-7facfe40590b2f9e.svg#codex-icon-arrow-down-lg-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">3. ¡Falta colocar la fotografía!</span></h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Esta parte es importante: el código necesita que tengas una imagen para mostrar.</span></p><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" data-d-flex-in-row="" style="flex: var(--w-box-flex-in-row, 0 0 auto); max-width: 768px; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 768px;"><div><div class="Grid-CGRmTR" data-d-component="grid" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2); grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0px, 1fr));"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-